Nature of Release

This is a deterministic observational reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate:

- ephemeris-independent observational structure
- deterministic sidereal realization
- offline browser-native astronomical observation
- structural propagation from embedded deterministic kernels

This release is not presented as:

- certified astronomical software
- prediction infrastructure
- production-grade astronomical tooling
- or authoritative professional Jyotish guidance

Behavioral guarantees apply only within the scope of the released reference implementation and its defined structural assumptions.

