Clarification — Relationship to Astronomy

This reference implementation does not claim that astronomical ephemerides are unnecessary.

Modern ephemeris systems remain among the most sophisticated astronomical achievements ever developed.

SSM-JA instead explores whether:

- bounded observational continuity
- reproducible sidereal realization
- Panchang propagation
- and long-horizon Dasha continuity

can emerge from:

- compact deterministic structure
- embedded sidereal kernels
- and offline structural propagation

