Privacy and Local Execution

SSM-JA follows an offline-first observational model.

The reference implementation does not:

- upload chart data
- require accounts
- require cloud synchronization
- maintain centralized chart storage
- transmit birth information remotely

All calculations occur locally inside the browser.

This is a deliberate architectural and privacy decision.

